          <small>(Anime)</small>
          <a href="https://myanimelist.net/ownlist/anime/add?selected_series_id=28617&amp;hideLayout=1" class="Lightbox_AddEdit button_add ga-click"><span class="ga-click ga-impression" data-ga-click-type="list-add-button" data-ga-click-param="aid:28617" data-work-type="anime" data-status="0" style="line-height: unset;" data-ga-impression-type="list-add-button">add</span></a>
